sequenceDiagram
    participant Sim as Simulator
    participant S as Source i
    participant ДВ as SelectionDispatcher (ДВ)
    participant ДП as PlacementDispatcher (ДП)
    participant D as Devices[1..4]
    participant B as Buffer (cap. 20)

    Note over Sim: step() handles the earliest event — an arrival<br/>or a service end (a service end goes first on a tie)

    loop every arrival of source i (ИЗ2 — uniform intervals)
        Sim->>S: generateNextRequest()
        S-->>Sim: Request r (next interval ~ U(a, b), ИЗ2)
        Sim->>Sim: recordArrival(r)
        Sim->>ДВ: tryServeDirectly(r)
        ДВ->>ДВ: isBatchActive()
        opt no batch is active
            ДВ->>D: selectFreeDevice(): scan from pointer, isFree()?
            D-->>ДВ: first free device k, or none
        end
    
        alt no batch active AND a free device k was found
            Note right of ДВ: Д2П2 — round-robin: first free<br/>device scanning from the pointer
            ДВ->>ДВ: advancePointer(index of k)
            ДВ->>D: k.startService(r, now)
            Note right of D: service time ~ Exp(λ), ПЗ1
            ДВ-->>Sim: true (served directly)
            Sim->>Sim: recordServiceStart(r)
        else a batch is active, OR all 4 devices are busy
            ДВ-->>Sim: false
            Note over Sim,ДВ: r may NOT bypass an active batch.<br/>Invariant I — while currentBatch has<br/>unassigned members, no device is idle.
            Sim->>ДП: onRequestArrival(r)
            ДП->>B: isFull()
            B-->>ДП: true / false
            alt buffer has a free slot
                Note right of ДП: Д1ОЗ3 — first free slot,<br/>no shifting
                ДП->>B: placeRequest(r)
                ДП-->>Sim: Optional.empty() (nothing refused)
            else buffer full (all 20 slots)
                Note right of ДП: Д1ОО2 — refuse the buffered request<br/>with the lowest priority (newest on a tie)
                ДП->>B: findLowestPriorityRequest()
                B-->>ДП: r_old
                ДП->>B: remove(r_old)
                ДП->>ДП: r_old.markRefused(now)
                ДП->>B: placeRequest(r)
                ДП-->>Sim: Optional.of(r_old) (refused)
                Sim->>Sim: recordRefusal(r_old)
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Sim,B: ... time passes, and device k finishes the request r_prev it was serving ...

    Sim->>D: k.completeService()
    D-->>Sim: Request r_prev (SERVED)
    Sim->>Sim: recordServiceEnd(r_prev)
    Sim->>ДВ: onDeviceFree(device k, now)
    ДВ->>ДВ: batchDevices.remove(device k)
    Note right of ДВ: a device leaves batchDevices<br/>only when its service has finished

    alt currentBatch AND batchDevices both empty (batch fully processed, or none active)
        ДВ->>ДВ: formNewBatch()
        ДВ->>B: highestPrioritySourcePresent()
        B-->>ДВ: sourceId, or empty if the buffer is empty
        opt buffer had a waiting request
            Note right of ДВ: Д2Б5 — freeze a NEW batch: ALL requests of<br/>that source now in the buffer, oldest first.<br/>Later arrivals do NOT join it.
            ДВ->>B: removeAllFromSource(sourceId)
            B-->>ДВ: currentBatch = [r1, r2, ...]
        end
    else currentBatch empty, but batchDevices not empty
        Note right of ДВ: the batch is still in service on other<br/>devices — the NEXT batch may not form yet
    else currentBatch still has unassigned members
        Note right of ДВ: the active batch continues
    end

    ДВ->>ДВ: dispatchBatch(now)
    loop while currentBatch not empty AND some device is free
        ДВ->>D: selectFreeDevice(): scan from pointer, isFree()?
        D-->>ДВ: first free device j
        Note right of ДВ: Д2П2 — round-robin selection
        ДВ->>ДВ: advancePointer(index of j)
        ДВ->>ДВ: take r_next from currentBatch,<br/>batchDevices.add(device j)
        ДВ->>D: j.startService(r_next, now)
        Note right of D: service time ~ Exp(λ), ПЗ1
    end
    Note right of ДВ: devices still free here stay idle — no batch<br/>member is left, or the buffer was empty
    ДВ-->>Sim: list of requests started (possibly empty)
    Sim->>Sim: recordServiceStart(each started request)

    Note over Sim,D: A buffered request r is served when a batch containing it is formed.<br/>This happens only when its source has the highest priority among<br/>sources in the buffer and the previous batch has fully finished.
